---
layout: page.njk
permalink: /notices/
title: Notices & merit lists
crumb: Notices
crumbs: []
description: "Admission notices, merit lists and exam schedules from RIPS Sheikhupura, newest first."
---
<h1>Notices &amp; merit lists</h1>
{%- set notices = collections.notices | currentNotices(build.today) %}
{%- if notices.length %}
<ul class="notice-list">
  {%- for n in notices %}
  <li class="notice-row">
    <h2 class="h3"><a href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p><span class="notice-type">{{ n.data.type }}</span><time datetime="{{ n.data.publish_at | isoDate }}">{{ n.data.publish_at | displayDate }}</time>{% if n.data.file %}<span>PDF {{ n.data.file | fileSize }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p class="empty-state">There are no current notices.</p>
{%- endif %}
